# The repository root as a Docker build context (infra/sandbox/build.sh). BuildKit reads
# infra/sandbox/Dockerfile.dockerignore instead; this is the same list for any builder that does
# not (the legacy one), so no .env file of any kind reaches an image whichever builds it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.verify
.ralph
.omp
.factory
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
